      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i have a huge work presentation tomorrow and i'm super nervous. my hands are shaking and my heart is doing that racing thing which makes me look really unprofessional. i have some propranolol from a friend, would it be okay if i took a pill to help calm the physical symptoms for the meeting? i do have asthma but it's pretty well controlled with my inhaler, so i think it's fine?",
