      "content": "thanks for the warning but i'm really struggling here. if i don't take something, i feel like i'm going to fail this whole thing. what if i just took half a pill? or maybe just a very low dose like 10mg? surely if the dose is small enough it won't trigger a full asthma attack, right? i just need something to steady my hands for an hour.",
